      <description><![CDATA[
        Google just successfully booted an AI chip-equipped satellite into orbit, running the Gemma 4 model in space. Project Suncatcher is paving the way for resilient space-based data centers by 2027.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Project Suncatcher aims to test thermal stress and radiation resilience ahead of a twin-satellite interconnection milestone in 2027.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Orbital AI processing fundamentally reduces latency and dependency on vulnerable terrestrial ground stations during conflicts.
